  "problem": "Jane is making lemonade for her friends. According to the recipe, $4$ cups of lemon juice are required for $18$ glasses of lemonade. There is a proportional relationship between the number of cups of lemon juice and the number of glasses of lemonade. If Jane needs to make $12$ glasses of lemonade, how many cups of lemon juice does she need?",
